WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.770 --> 00:00:07.020
Swapping leather jackets for Christmas coats
– hundreds of motorbikers donned their Santa

00:00:07.020 --> 00:00:13.930
costumes for a festive parade through Berlin,
all for a good cause: raising awareness for

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:17.600
those in need in their city.

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:23.240
"We want to step on the gas and say, take
a look, especially at Christmas.

00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:28.160
It is, after all, the season to open your
heart and perhaps be a bit more generous."

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:32.059
"First of all, it’s a good thing which I’d
like to support.

00:00:32.059 --> 00:00:34.170
And second, it's of course wonderful to ride
in such a big group.

00:00:34.170 --> 00:00:38.780
Already on the way here, you see children
in their cars waving, taking photos, everyone

00:00:38.780 --> 00:00:39.780
is cheerful.

00:00:39.780 --> 00:00:42.120
That’s why I want to do it again every year."

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:48.850
"You ride through the city, everyone laughs
when they see us and waves, and are cheerful

00:00:48.850 --> 00:00:49.850
and happy.

00:00:49.850 --> 00:00:51.820
It's really great."

00:00:51.820 --> 00:00:56.899
On their tour, bikers stop off at charities,
bringing gifts.

00:00:56.899 --> 00:01:03.650
For this care facility for young people, they've
brought a couple of TVs.

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:10.210
Ahead of the parade, the bikers collected
donations to be able to fulfill.

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:15.130
"When people do something for other people
without expecting anything in return, but

00:01:15.130 --> 00:01:22.100
simply to give something – that deserves
a big round of applause."

00:01:22.100 --> 00:01:27.670
Braving frosty weather, the bikers rode for
four hours through the city.

00:01:27.670 --> 00:01:33.280
Berlin’s bikers first came up with the idea
for a parade more than 20 years ago – back

00:01:33.280 --> 00:01:35.249
then, there were just two of them.

00:01:35.249 --> 00:01:41.240
Now, more than 200 bikers take part – and
hundreds more come to watch.

00:01:41.240 --> 00:01:46.140
Berlin’s bikers have now become something
of a Christmas attraction.

